"name": "Patrick Industries, Inc.",
"description": "Patrick Industries, Inc. is a component solutions provider serving original equipment manufacturers and aftermarket customers in the RV, Marine, Powersports and Housing markets. Since formation, Patrick has empowered manufacturers and outdoor enthusiasts to achieve next-level recreation experiences. Its customer-focused approach brings together design, manufacturing, distribution, and transportation in a full solutions model that defines us as a trusted partner. Patrick is home to more than 85 brands, all united by a commitment to quality, customer service, and innovation. The company was founded in 1959 and is headquartered in Elkhart, IN.",
